      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:1:4:70:6",
      "text": [
        " كُنْتُ قَاعِداً عِنْدَ أَبِي جَعْفَرٍ ( عليه السلام ) فَأَقْبَلَ جَعْفَرٌ ( عليه السلام ) فَقَالَ أَبُو جَعْفَرٍ ( عليه السلام ) هَذَا خَيْرُ الْبَرِيَّةِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Mihran, from Muhammad Bin Ali, from Fuzayl Bin Usman, from Tahir who said, ",
          "‘I was seated in the presence of Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup>, so he<sup>asws</sup> kissed Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> and Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘This one<sup>asws</sup> is the best of the Created beings’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          " 6. Ahmad ibn Mihran has narrated from Muhammad ibn Ali from Fudayl ibn ‘Uthman from who has said the following. “Once I was in the presence of abu Ja‘far (a.s.) that Ja‘far (a.s.) came. Abu Ja‘far (a.s.) said, “This (Ja‘far) is the best of the people.”"
        ]
      }
